{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261019/photo/bkn-20261019080110506-1019_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261019100323\"/><p>天文台預測今日陽光充沛。</p><p>高空反氣旋正為華南帶來普遍晴朗的天氣。今日(19日)上午9時天文台錄得氣溫攝氏28度，相對濕度百分之72。過去一小時，京士柏錄得的平均紫外線指數是2，強度屬於低。</p><p>天文台預測今日陽光充沛，天氣乾燥及炎熱。吹輕微至和緩偏東風。展望未來數日大致天晴及乾燥。周三(21日)日間酷熱。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T02:19:29.518772+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T00:01:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T03:37:44.588008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T02:17:51.151278+00:00","content_hash":"daa5366b7df6d29af25b2e17b3ca5494e9edb4f5dc7bdaeb2274bafa4e500cff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}